      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling that existence is pointless is incredibly exhausting, but it is not a valid reason to give up on life for good. Many people experience similar states where their future doesn't look bright, yet those moments often shift with time and new perspectives. Your worth isn't rewritten by your current struggle, and taking one small step—like talking to a professional—to explore these feelings can begin to bring light back into the shadows.",
